message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "fmlip-relay"
abstract: >
  Persistent server for machine-learned interatomic potentials with a Fortran
  client. The Python server loads a model once and answers energy, force,
  stress, per-atom energy and Hessian requests over a loopback TCP socket.
